sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Administrateur SaaS
    participant NG as Front admin (bloc lazy)
    participant MW as AdminIPWhitelist + RateLimit
    participant API as apps.admin_panel
    participant RD as Redis (admin_revocation, fail-closed)

    A->>NG: e-mail + mot de passe
    NG->>MW: POST /api/admin/auth/login/
    MW->>MW: IP dans ADMIN_ALLOWED_IPS ? (sinon 403 nu)
    MW->>API: transmet
    API-->>NG: 200 { session_token }  (5 min, usage TOTP uniquement)

    A->>NG: saisit le code TOTP (6 chiffres)
    NG->>API: POST /api/admin/auth/totp-verify/ { session_token, totp_code }
    API->>API: pyotp.verify (valid_window=1)
    API->>RD: cache.add("totp_used_<id>_<code>", ttl=90)  (anti-rejeu)
    API-->>NG: 200 { access } (15 min, jti) + Set-Cookie admin_refresh (HttpOnly, path=/api/admin/auth/)
    NG->>NG: jeton admin EN MÉMOIRE uniquement

    rect rgb(248,240,240)
    Note over NG,RD: à chaque refresh : ancien jti blacklisté dans admin_revocation<br/>si Redis KO -> jeton refusé (S21)
    end
